  <h4>General Requirements</h4>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Transport:</strong> 100,000 to 150,000 (depends on distance from school).</li>
    <li><strong>School Uniform includes:</strong> Sweater, sportswear, socks, belts, and school uniform.</li>
    <li><strong>Boarding Learners:</strong> Must report with 2kg of sugar and 3 bars of soap per child.</li>
    <li><strong>Water:</strong> Carry bottled mineral water for learners.</li>
  </ul>

